; AlifeTactics faction flavor - the participation chance a faction's stalker carries each behavior. Paired
; with gamedata/scripts/at_faction.script. Section = faction, key = the decision, value = 0..1.
; Lookup: [<faction>] key, else [default] key, else 1 (carries it). Participation is one of the two gates:
; it rolls against the capped chance AND the Intelligence roll (MCM base + per-rank), the combined answer
; rolled once per NPC per key and held for the fight; 0 never rolls. Zombied never participate in anything,
; a universal rule in at_faction.script, so no [zombied] section exists.

[caps] ; nothing is ever certain: both gates cap here
participation = 0.75
intelligence  = 0.75

